[Music]  hey guys this is vic and today we're  going to be testing out four famous  celebrity pasta recipes to find out  which one is actually the best on  today's lineup we have meghan markle  robert pattinson caitlyn jenner and a  fun one from rihanna i measured out all  the ingredients exactly as each recipe  stated and i got three pasta lovers to  pick their favorite recipe so which  celebrity has the best pasta recipe  let's get started first up is her royal  highness meghan markle she starts off by  creating what she calls her filthy sexy  mush a zucchini based sauce boiled for  four hours  she boils up her rigatoni  adds lemon juice red chili flakes  parmesan cheese and mixes it all  together until the pasta is evenly  coated there you have it meghan markle's  pasta  there doesn't seem to be a ton of  ingredients this looks kind of  this looks a little dry but really  interesting these are probably  vegetables yeah maybe it's on the  healthier side  it's not as bad as it looks it's got a  little bit of a kick it wouldn't be my  first choice i think it's a little bland  not the most flavorful i'd say but like  it's pretty good out of one or ten i  would give it like a fair six this one's  okay not my fave next up is caitlyn  jenner she starts by boiling her pasta  she chops up some peppers and throws  them in a pan with a little oil until  they get tender  she then adds hot italian sausage and  breaks it up into little bite-sized  pieces she stirs garlic red pepper  flakes and adds a pepper mixture basil  parsley and parmesan cheese mixes it  together and serves it topping it off  with a little parmesan and there you  have it caitlyn jenner's celsius and  pepper pasta i love the color in the mix  this looks like something i'm into we  got some veggies we got some meat  those are like it's a bit greasy that's  the only thing that i was saying this  looks like something that i could order  at a restaurant the meatball or sausage  situation is really well done it has a  little bit of a spice i would see myself  making this at home next up we have  robert pattinson's picolini cuccino or  little pillow in italian robert starts  cooking his pasta in the microwave for  about 10 minutes next he makes a  bowl-shaped mold out of aluminum foil he  puts in crushed corn flakes sugar cheese  tomato sauce more sugar than dumps in  the cooked pasta he tops it off with his  pc branded bun and puts it in the oven  for 10 minutes to melt the ingredients  together a little different but there  you have it robert pattinson's piccolini  cucino i like how this looks already are  these corn flakes not used to that  really being in there this looks pretty  good  okay um take all that back this is  really good this is like definitely  comfort food you got your cheese you got  your sugar you got tons of carbs i need  to know who made this we need to have a  chat i love the tomato sauce and there's  cheese i didn't expect to like it  because there's a lot going on but yeah  i'd eat this i could see like flakes of  sugar at the bottom of my bowl this is  so sad this reminds me of a lasagna it's  very homemade style i like it a lot  finally the recipe you've all been  waiting for rihanna's spicy chicken  pasta she starts by cooking her pasta  shells then she chops up onion garlic  peppers and green onions tossing them in  a pan with a little olive oil once the  veggies are tender she throws her  marinated chicken and cooks until the  chicken is through  she builds her pasta by adding hot sauce  mustard butter the chicken pepper mix  and a plate of cheese and stirs until  combined there you have it rihanna's  spicy chicken pasta this looks fancy it  looks like it's curry style we're seeing  some variety of meat and veggie mmm i  like there's a little kick the flavor is  good it's strong i wish it were like a  little more saucy but it's good i can  see myself eating this without feeling  guilty the chicken's more flavorful than  the noodles themselves still overall  feels like a fancy-ish meal  so which celebrity has the best pasta  recipe let's find out out of these four  celebrity pasta recipes my favorite  would have to be number two it had a  really nice kick it was really flavorful  the meat was well seasoned in flavor  there was really good veggies in there  kaitlyn  girl i'm really intrigued by number  three  so much going on with the corn flakes  with the cheese with the tomato with the  bun you got the sweet you got the savory  it really has all of the comfort food  flavors what  and even though he makes pasta out of  the four celebrity dishes that i tried  my favorite has to be the third dish  that bread sold me along with that pasta  sauce  really that's his recipe  there you have it robert pattinson has  the best pasta recipe  which recipe should we try next leave a  comment below  [Music]  you

